WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.399 --> 00:00:04.400
Speaker 1: Georgia is potentially going to
elect.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.450
Herschel Walker.

00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:12.210
Herschel Walker doesn't live in Georgia and
it is now becoming even more clear because

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:14.670
of an audio recording that has been resurfaced.

00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:17.900
So let me give you the back story on this
and then I'm going to play a very important

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.380
clip for you.

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:23.539
One of the things we've known about Herschel
Walker, a former football player running as

00:00:23.539 --> 00:00:28.960
a Republican for senator in Georgia against
the incumbent Democratic Senator Raphael Warnock.

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:33.080
The runoff is on December six and we will
have live results for you next Tuesday.

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:38.899
One of the things that we learned about him
is that he really has lived in Texas for a

00:00:38.899 --> 00:00:45.420
while, but he claimed that he also lived in
Georgia.

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:49.870
And we are aware of a property that Herschel
Walker has in Georgia.

00:00:49.870 --> 00:00:58.070
But now, due to a combination of new reporting
and a resurfaced audiotape, we have learned

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:00.650
that he doesn't really live in Georgia.

00:01:00.650 --> 00:01:05.600
He admits that he lives in Texas, at least
he did a few months ago.

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:09.810
And also the property in Georgia was up until
recently rented out.

00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:11.580
So he couldn't possibly be living there.

00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:13.650
Yes, he owned a property.

00:01:13.650 --> 00:01:17.110
He had an address where he could say, this
is my house, but he didn't live there and

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:18.900
it was, in fact, rented out to somebody else.

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:21.110
So let's go through this piece by piece.

00:01:21.110 --> 00:01:25.020
First and foremost, we have this new admission
from Herschel Walker.

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:26.930
The Guardian is reporting about it.

00:01:26.930 --> 00:01:28.900
I live in Texas.

00:01:28.900 --> 00:01:34.200
Herschel Walker speech ads to Georgia Senate
Run Problems.

00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:39.090
In a campaign speech earlier this year, Herschel
Walker, the Republican candidate, said, I

00:01:39.090 --> 00:01:40.190
live in Texas.

00:01:40.190 --> 00:01:41.680
I live in Texas.

00:01:41.680 --> 00:01:44.910
Let's go to that audio.

00:01:44.910 --> 00:01:48.710
It's not the best quality audio, but I think
we're not going to have a problem making it

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:49.710
out.

00:01:49.710 --> 00:01:59.400
Speaker 3: When they asked me, why did I run
for a Senate seat?

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:01.900
Because to be honest with you, this is never
coming out.

00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:02.900
Ever, ever, ever.

00:02:02.900 --> 00:02:04.560
And I'm it's true.

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:08.729
But I was sitting in my home in Texas.

00:02:08.729 --> 00:02:10.251
Speaker 1: I saw.

00:02:10.251 --> 00:02:12.200
Okay, I was sitting in my home in Texas.

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:14.760
That doesn't mean he doesn't also live in
Georgia.

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:15.760
Okay.

00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:16.760
But so that's a start.

00:02:16.760 --> 00:02:18.470
Speaker 3: Let's continue in my home in Texas.

00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:24.410
And I was seeing what was going on in this
country.

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:26.370
You know, I lived in Texas.

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:27.370
Speaker 1: Yeah.

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:30.590
I went down to the border and I live in Texas
and I went down to the border.

00:02:30.590 --> 00:02:34.560
This is in the context of running for Georgia
Senate.

00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:39.290
And he says, I live in Texas and I went down
to the border.

00:02:39.290 --> 00:02:45.100
Now, of course, he thought that it made sense
strategically to tout his bona fides about

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:46.959
knowing what's happening at the border.

00:02:46.959 --> 00:02:52.470
The problem is you claim to live in Georgia,
but you say, actually, I know about the border

00:02:52.470 --> 00:02:53.860
because I live in Texas.

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:56.040
And then and it just keeps coming.

00:02:56.040 --> 00:03:02.120
We learned yesterday Herschel Walker's Georgia
home is a rental property.

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:04.879
The route reporting via Yahoo News.

00:03:04.879 --> 00:03:09.900
Herschel Walker, his most recent scandal is
actually an old one going all the way back

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:12.890
to his campaign announcement last year.

00:03:12.890 --> 00:03:17.330
It's been reported that Walker actually didn't
live in Georgia, the state he wants to represent,

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:19.010
at least not full time.

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:23.390
He owns a house in suburban Dallas that he
and his current wife occupied for years.

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:33.170
And Walker receives a homestead tax exemption,
which is reserved for a person's primary residence.

00:03:33.170 --> 00:03:35.010
Hmm.

00:03:35.010 --> 00:03:39.250
But Walker has always had an ace in the hole
to use for plausible deniability.

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:41.030
He still owns a house in Georgia.

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:45.629
A campaign finance report last year values
the house between 20 and $500,000 as long

00:03:45.629 --> 00:03:46.970
as it exists.

00:03:46.970 --> 00:03:50.909
Walker can rebut his critics with the fact
that plenty of people own houses in more than

00:03:50.909 --> 00:03:51.909
one state.

00:03:51.909 --> 00:03:57.640
Now, a new report pokes holes in that idea
with receipts that until recently, Walker's

00:03:57.640 --> 00:04:05.200
Georgia home was occupied by renters who paid
Walker and his wife thousands.

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:07.900
And The Daily Beast has the specifics.

00:04:07.900 --> 00:04:14.349
The house doubled as the Walker campaign's
official address when he launched his bid.

00:04:14.349 --> 00:04:21.570
Records show it's owned by Walker's wife,
solely who was collecting rental income on

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:22.720
it.

00:04:22.720 --> 00:04:29.060
It's his wife's house, and it at least was
until recently, rented out.

00:04:29.060 --> 00:04:35.520
Herschel Walker was clearly not prepared to
deal with this issue in the way that Mehmet

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:37.729
Oz was prepared to deal with it.

00:04:37.729 --> 00:04:44.450
Mehmet Oz certainly isn't from Pennsylvania,
but he was slightly more credibly able to

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:49.139
make the case that he's sort of from Pennsylvania
and lives in Pennsylvania.

00:04:49.139 --> 00:04:50.500
He has more than two houses.

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:53.090
I don't even remember the number at this point
in time.

00:04:53.090 --> 00:04:54.970
So Herschel Walker caught in another lie.

00:04:54.970 --> 00:04:59.479
Now, quite frankly, I don't think this is
going to make a very big difference.

00:04:59.479 --> 00:05:03.310
Right wingers will say Democrats are the devil.

00:05:03.310 --> 00:05:09.650
I don't care where Herschel Walker lives,
it's better for the country and for the state

00:05:09.650 --> 00:05:12.610
for Walker to be representing us rather than
Warnock.

00:05:12.610 --> 00:05:13.620
And he could live in Alaska.

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:14.620
He could live in Timbuktu.

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:16.100
I don't really care.

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:18.750
But the race is expected to be relatively
close.

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:23.199
There's a lot of little things that have been
going against Herschel Walker.

00:05:23.199 --> 00:05:28.590
And if this has even a very small impact,
it's now a growing list of things which hopefully

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:30.169
will give us the results that we want.

00:05:30.169 --> 00:05:31.789
On Tuesday, we're going to be live with the
results.

00:05:31.789 --> 00:05:34.090
On Tuesday, of course, starting.

00:05:34.090 --> 00:05:35.510
You know, I actually don't know.

00:05:35.510 --> 00:05:37.960
I think the polls close at eight in Georgia.

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:40.889
I'm going to double check that if indeed the
polls close at eight.

00:05:40.889 --> 00:05:46.010
We'll probably be live at 7:30 p.m. Eastern
Time and then the results will start coming

00:05:46.010 --> 00:05:47.010
in.

00:05:47.010 --> 00:05:51.110
If I learn that the results won't even start
coming in until nine, maybe we'll start at

00:05:51.110 --> 00:05:52.110
830.

00:05:52.110 --> 00:05:54.070
But I will be live on YouTube, Twitter and
Facebook.

00:05:54.070 --> 00:05:59.220
I hope that you will join me and we will have
all of the clips I played here today on our

00:05:59.220 --> 00:06:03.839
Instagram, which you can find by searching
Instagram for David Pakman show.

